<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 20px">How we fix it</p>
  <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:0 0 56px;max-width:820px">Three steps, in this order.</h2>
  <div class="g3"><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 01</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Audit the links you have</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We check every referring domain. Harmful links are documented, and a removal file is submitted where needed.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 02</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Find the sites your buyers read</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Trade publications, industry blogs and directories where your customers already spend time.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 03</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Earn links with real content</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Guest posts, expert quotes and PR that give the other site a reason to link to you.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
  <div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:50px">
