    <p class="p" style="font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 18px">In one six-month engagement, a cleanup of around 200 harmful referring domains went alongside new relevant links. The domain’s rating moved from 43 to 45, and it reached more search terms on page one.</p>
    <a href="/case-studies/golf" class="label red">Read the golf equipment case study →</a>
  </div>
